error_signature: "python-require|BINARY_SKIP|package_folder=None|runenv 不聚合|requires run=True"
root_cause: "Conan 2.29 对无 C 头/库的依赖（如 python-require 包 pyelftools）在消费方 graph 计算中，若 requires 未显式声明 run=True，会按 _skip_binaries 逻辑（files=(headers|libs|run|build) 全空）判 BINARY_SKIP：package_folder=None，runenv（PYTHONPATH 等）不聚合到下游，下游脚本 import 时找不到模块。"
rec_approach: "消费 python 模块类依赖时，requires() 显式写 run=True（如 self.requires(\"pyelftools/0.33\", run=True)），并在 conanfile 注释记录原因。诊断手段：conan graph info 看该节点是否 BINARY_SKIP / package_folder 是否 None；conan install 后 conanrunenv.sh 里是否有 PYTHONPATH。"
match_keywords: ["conan 2", "python-require", "BINARY_SKIP", "run=True", "PYTHONPATH", "runenv 聚合", "package_folder None"]
error_excerpt: "conan graph info: pyelftools/0.33 ... Binary: Skipped（package_folder=None）→ 下游 python 脚本 ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'elftools'"
severity: P1
category: recipe
last_updated: 2026-10-14
